## E14 macOS rerun

The command copied the same three manifests to two macOS temporary directories,
added only the same empty temporary target stubs, cloned the official RustSec
advisory database into a third temporary directory, then ran the recommended
and one-line `anyhow = "=1.0.102"` control workspaces.

Command body:

```text
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/RustSec/advisory-db.git <temporary-db>
cargo generate-lockfile
cargo audit --db <temporary-db> --no-fetch
perl -0pi -e 's/anyhow = "1\.0\.104"/anyhow = "=1.0.102"/' crates/rslb-cli/Cargo.toml
cargo generate-lockfile
cargo audit --db <temporary-db> --no-fetch
